      "name": "Semantic Confusion Over 'Exceeds'",
      "type": "Concept",
      "description": "A semantic misunderstanding regarding the mathematical term 'exceeds' (vượt quá), confusing strict inequality (>) with greater-than-or-equal-to (\\ge), such as around a 3.75 kg threshold."
